        s\u1EBD m\u1EA5t hi\u1EC7u \u1EE9ng n\xE0y. Khi ti\xEAu di\u1EC7t th\xE0nh
        c\xF4ng m\u1ED9t m\u1EE5c ti\xEAu trong th\u1EDDi gian hi\u1EC7u l\u1EF1c,
