    - displayName: Nova Rush
      icon: {fileID: 0}
      subtitle: 
      costLabel: 
      energyText: 35
      cooldownText: 7s
      description: "Th\u1EF1c hi\u1EC7n pha l\u01B0\u1EDBt nhanh t\u1EE9c th\xEC
        v\u1EC1 v\u1ECB tr\xED ch\u1EC9 \u0111\u1ECBnh. L\u1EA7n t\u1EA5n c\xF4ng
        th\xE0nh c\xF4ng ngay sau khi k\u1EBFt th\xFAc c\xFA l\u01B0\u1EDBt s\u1EBD
